{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"bde465a3ea7911fe","children":[{"parent":"30658e59948eea34","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"88091f87245117c8","title":"就是一个固定的套路。只需要遵循这个套路，就可以从文件中读数据。<br>固定的几个步骤。&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"30658e59948eea34","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"1e690553109f2998","title":"读数据：&nbsp;简单说就是一个管子连着文件，一个管子连着程序。<br>在程序中，有一个开关，拧一下这个开关，进来一些数据。&nbsp;<br>最后，拧到没数据的时候，数据就读完了。"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"30658e59948eea34","title":"流就是一个编程模型。就是用来给程序读取或者输出数据到外部的。&nbsp;<br>让程序员，可以用一种比较简单的方式读取数据。"},{"parent":"bde465a3ea7911fe","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"241a6a4ebe2ea05e","title":"文件流：&nbsp;就是操作文件的一个流。我们可以通过文件流，从文件中读数据，往文件里面写数据"},{"parent":"bde465a3ea7911fe","children":[{"parent":"b54b8c3b859fab6a","children":[{"parent":"004ebadf99960a85","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c6f9b7ada774f111","title":"windows里面的绝对路径，就是从盘符开始的一个路径<br>E:\\Users\\zhoubing\\Desktop\\cpp64_code\\Day15_文件流\\06_路径问题\\test2\\test3\\111.txt<br>"},{"parent":"004ebadf99960a85","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6f464ab1ceb7ff5d","title":"Linux里面的绝对路径，就是从/<br>/wangdao/share/c++/tools/1.mp4<br>"},{"parent":"004ebadf99960a85","children":[{"parent":"409e67d2beea030f","children":[],"id":"d361968625ddd51a","title":"路径基本不会出错，非常方便，但是在工作中，由于需要多人协作，无法保证绝对路径的使用。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"409e67d2beea030f","title":"绝对路径用的少"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"004ebadf99960a85","title":"绝对路径"},{"parent":"b54b8c3b859fab6a","children":[{"parent":"4803e89f5205ccbc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"30041f12863f7c6e","title":"相对的是谁。&nbsp;在vs中，写代码的时候，相对路径指的是：程序启动时候的项目根目录"},{"parent":"4803e89f5205ccbc","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"2de1437cfeb33075","title":"相对路径的关键问题是：&nbsp;相对的是谁"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"4803e89f5205ccbc","title":"相对路径"},{"parent":"b54b8c3b859fab6a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f3c9df271a874bbe","title":"相对路径和绝对路径，是用来在程序中唯一定位一个文件的。&nbsp;<br>文件流，里面需要用路径来唯一确定一个文件。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"b54b8c3b859fab6a","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c8c21e45a3586f14","title":".当前路径。 ..&nbsp;上一级路径"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"b54b8c3b859fab6a","title":"路径问题"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"bde465a3ea7911fe","title":"流"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"84d173bb8e7cc9a7","children":[{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"be87851c9f98b5bd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"88b77b32ef06c231","title":"打开文件流"},{"parent":"be87851c9f98b5bd","children":[{"parent":"bbd9985e68ccf0be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b81114f53dfa3bf8","title":"FILE是一个结构体。&nbsp;里面存储了各种信息。&nbsp;但是我们目前不关心字段，<br>我们只要知道，后续的操作都是以&nbsp;FILE *&nbsp;作为参数的。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"bbd9985e68ccf0be","title":"FILE* fopen(const char *path, const char *mode);<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"be87851c9f98b5bd","title":"fopen"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"19c6f66e0db2ca87","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"21160bbd90d2f444","title":"关闭文件流"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"19c6f66e0db2ca87","title":"fclose"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"393058a188160d36","children":[{"parent":"5b5320abf75c57c1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6be831a8f5f4f9e1","title":"fclose(fp);<br>缓冲区的数据，会刷新出去"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5b5320abf75c57c1","title":"1.打开文件流<br>2.检查拿到的FILE指针，是否为空<br>3.用完之后，<br>4.关闭文件流"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"393058a188160d36","title":"流操作的固定步骤"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"1babba077af439a1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"8cd6599d02e28be5","title":"从文件流里读数据。&nbsp;一个字节一个字节的读。&nbsp;读到最后，如果没数据了，这时候返回 -1(EOF)"},{"parent":"1babba077af439a1","children":[{"parent":"4195d487b7de869c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a2eb5a66f84104bd","title":"int fgetc(FILE* stream);"},{"parent":"4195d487b7de869c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a0873bccbf58c5ec","title":"int fputc(int c, FILE* stream);"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4195d487b7de869c","title":"fputc :&nbsp;把程序里面的数据，输出到文件中。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"1babba077af439a1","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e67309d35579b0f3","title":"单个字符单个字符处理的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"1babba077af439a1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"297d7016ced7f2e1","title":"使用fgetc、fputc完成一个文件的复制工作。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"1babba077af439a1","title":"fgetc/fputc"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"8e6522be2b2ad3d5","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"333195c285ed97dc","title":"一个字符串，一个字符串拿数据"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8e6522be2b2ad3d5","title":"fgets/fputs"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"68e43caab40e5807","children":[{"parent":"1cbf1580f09d2340","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"206af6aff344ebcd","title":"文件不存在会报错。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1cbf1580f09d2340","title":"r表示读"},{"parent":"68e43caab40e5807","children":[{"parent":"590a3c63a7fcba6d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"70f4d4dcd67af929","title":"文件不存在，会新建文件"},{"parent":"590a3c63a7fcba6d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c76df84821aec817","title":"文件存在，会截断文件"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"590a3c63a7fcba6d","title":"w表示写"},{"parent":"68e43caab40e5807","children":[{"parent":"cecb4ced40e70159","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6bc28398710ea3a0","title":"在文件后面追加"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"cecb4ced40e70159","title":"a表示追加"},{"parent":"68e43caab40e5807","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"d8c2f80b80ec01cd","title":"平时，我们在使用文件流的时候，一般很少打开一个文件流，既读又写，而且这个场景非常容易出错。&nbsp;<br>所以，建议，使用流，要么使用这个流读，要么使用这个流写。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"68e43caab40e5807","title":"模式的问题"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"49c4aa14ed54f857","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f63e84e5a750fbc1","title":"在windows中，使用&nbsp; \\r\\n作为换行符<br>在Linux/Mac中，使用&nbsp; \\n作为换行符"},{"parent":"49c4aa14ed54f857","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"312a6f39bd0dd296","title":"在C中，这里有一个适配，在程序中，向文件中输出&nbsp; \\n(换行符)，但是最终存储到文件中，是&nbsp; \\r\\n<br>文件中是&nbsp; \\r\\n ，程序在读取的时候，会变成 \\n"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"49c4aa14ed54f857","title":"换行符问题"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"ee1c4c0678cd4bd1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"10e8736f7aaebebd","title":"输入和输出。以一种格式化的方式输入和输出"},{"parent":"ee1c4c0678cd4bd1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"14db406146693432","title":"fprintf(fp, \"%d %lf\", num1, f1)"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ee1c4c0678cd4bd1","title":"fscanf和fprintf&nbsp;"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"c62f27a74ca68885","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dcc6d5cc2dab4639","title":"以二进制的方式读取或者输入"},{"parent":"c62f27a74ca68885","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5f1145c8f7e049de","title":"好处：&nbsp;更快一点"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c62f27a74ca68885","title":"fread和fwrite"},{"parent":"28c3863661b63401","children":[{"parent":"ad0017ca1e20b659","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"70d66760c1d3a338","title":"后续在碰到这些功能的时候，心中知道要用哪个函数<br>再去查入参和返回值，再使用"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ad0017ca1e20b659","title":"不要死记硬背函数。&nbsp;主要先理解这些函数是干什么的。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"28c3863661b63401","title":"基础操作"},{"parent":"84d173bb8e7cc9a7","children":[{"parent":"c7a0cc237343e44a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c492f8ff67e60d7b","title":"perror(\"hello\")"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c7a0cc237343e44a","title":"API非常多。&nbsp;建议大家按照种类记。建议只记功能。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"84d173bb8e7cc9a7","children":[{"parent":"922ab37e9c36e474","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9261f8453ab87361","title":"就是一些函数，系统提供的，完成特定功能的。&nbsp;"}],"id":"922ab37e9c36e474","title":"API"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"84d173bb8e7cc9a7","title":"API"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\